cnt":[7,13,14,15,14,16,18,18,17,17,11,7]},"desc":"Each round one player becomes the first zombie. Zombies infect, humans survive until the timer ends. Some rounds turn into Nemesis, Survivor, Swarm, Plague, Assassin or Sniper.\n\nPick a zombie or human class, each with its own skill. Deal damage to earn ammo packs, then buy grenades, night vision, armor or a jetpack with a bazooka.\n\nNEW: Base Builder! Humans build a base from the map's blocks while the zombies wait, then hold out until time is up. Also: Fun Modes (CT vs T on classic maps), Zombie Escape and Boss Arena with 6 bosses every 30 minutes.\n\nClans get 3 weekly and 3 daily goals for ammo packs. Join the Tenshi-Studio group for 25% faster ammo packs (Premium also gets 25%, both get 50%). Free ammo packs every day, plus 1 extra each round with a friend in the server.\n\nPC: WASD, mouse, M menu, O settings, E class skill. Phone and controller supported.\n\nIf you enjoy the game, please give the game a like 👍","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-be492d1f10c4a232b02c02cbe845c4c9/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-51cdd9e86a3afd4dc9a261bf80e68df6/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3ca82a9ea536eecf5f758394021358b4/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"]}